<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 294 0 R
/T (This project leverages blockchain technology integrated with real-time data processors such as IoT devices to create a platform for carbon credit and electricity trading. By utilizing privacy-preserving technologies like zk-SNARKs, the platform ensures transparent transactions while maintaining user privacy. The system facilitates secure, traceable, and privacy-preserving trading to promote sustainability and efficient energy markets.)
/E (This project leverages blockchain technology integrated with real-time data processors such as IoT devices to create a platform for carbon credit and electricity trading. By utilizing privacy-preserving technologies like zk-SNARKs, the platform ensures transparent transactions while maintaining user privacy. The system facilitates secure, traceable, and privacy-preserving trading to promote sustainability and efficient energy markets.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
